  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SI-Improving the indoor air quality to reduce health risks for susceptible groups in Vietnam.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VN2022SIN364A103
01/09/2022 - 31/08/2024
In this project, it will be evaluated to which extent the susceptible population groups in Vietnam are exposed to indoor air pollutants. With the aim to create awareness among the population of the associated health risks and to enable access to advanced analytical methods to measure and analyse these pollutants in the air.</narrative>
  </description>
